{
  "model": "scripted-vision:latest",
  "maxEdge": 1280,
  "turns": [
    {
      "name": "off",
      "expectPromptContains": "cu-off",
      "steps": [
        {
          "text": "I cannot see your screen: computer use is off."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "probe",
      "expectPromptContains": "cu-probe",
      "steps": [
        {
          "call": "cu_begin",
          "input": {
            "goal": "cu-probe: look at the GIMP window",
            "apps": [
              "${GIMP_APP}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_click",
          "target": {
            "outside": true
          },
          "input": {
            "button": "left"
          },
          "expectError": "outside"
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_done",
          "input": {
            "summary": "Looked at GIMP."
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Probe finished."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "deny",
      "expectPromptContains": "cu-deny",
      "steps": [
        {
          "call": "cu_begin",
          "input": {
            "goal": "cu-deny: export beach as PNG to Pictures",
            "apps": [
              "${GIMP_APP}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_done",
          "input": {
            "summary": "Export blocked by U-1 dialog capture contract; U/V resolution required."
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Export blocked: U/V must resolve invisible dialog capture and input before approval or denial can be tested."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "export",
      "expectPromptContains": "export it as PNG to Pictures",
      "steps": [
        {
          "call": "cu_begin",
          "input": {
            "goal": "open the GIMP image beach.xcf and export it as PNG to Pictures",
            "apps": [
              "${GIMP_APP}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_done",
          "input": {
            "summary": "Export blocked by U-1 dialog capture contract; U/V resolution required."
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Export blocked: U/V must resolve invisible dialog capture and input before approval or denial can be tested."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "excluded",
      "expectPromptContains": "cu-excluded",
      "steps": [
        {
          "call": "cu_begin",
          "input": {
            "goal": "cu-excluded: press a key in GIMP",
            "apps": [
              "${GIMP_APP}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_key",
          "input": {
            "combo": "ctrl+shift+e"
          },
          "expectError": "excluded"
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_done",
          "input": {
            "summary": "A terminal has focus."
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "I cannot type while a terminal has focus."
        }
      ],
      "mask": {
        "mode": "all-black"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "stuck",
      "expectPromptContains": "cu-stuck",
      "steps": [
        {
          "call": "cu_begin",
          "input": {
            "goal": "cu-stuck: keep looking",
            "apps": [
              "${GIMP_APP}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_key",
          "input": {
            "combo": "shift"
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_key",
          "input": {
            "combo": "shift"
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_key",
          "input": {
            "combo": "shift"
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_key",
          "input": {
            "combo": "shift"
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_key",
          "input": {
            "combo": "shift"
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_key",
          "input": {
            "combo": "shift"
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "text": "Still nothing changed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "lock",
      "expectPromptContains": "cu-lock",
      "steps": [
        {
          "call": "cu_begin",
          "input": {
            "goal": "cu-lock: hold the session",
            "apps": [
              "${GIMP_APP}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {},
          "hold": 20,
          "expectError": [
            "paused",
            "no-session"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Stopped."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "physical",
      "expectPromptContains": "cu-physical",
      "steps": [
        {
          "call": "cu_begin",
          "input": {
            "goal": "cu-physical: hold the session",
            "apps": [
              "${GIMP_APP}"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {}
        },
        {
          "call": "screen_look",
          "input": {},
          "hold": 20,
          "expectError": [
            "paused",
            "no-session"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Stopped."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "concerns": [
    "Escalation to U/V: contracts §4 U-1 makes only the original allowed GIMP toplevel fullscreen. Export Image and Export Image as PNG are separate toplevels: their titles/rectangles are redacted and their focus makes captures all black. X cannot locate or verify their save buttons via screen.look. U/V must agree a safe visible, focusable dialog capture/input contract before X10/X11 can test Review Focus 4 (deny leaves no file; approve writes PNG). These turns are blocked and do not claim consequential-card or export coverage.",
    "X10/X11: ordinary fullscreen screenshots have vacuous:true and ok:false because there are no foreign pixels to inspect. This means missing mask evidence, not a leak. Require a controlled all-black capture (turn.mask or step.mask mode all-black), or a known full-frame fixture (mode fixture with pngBase64) before asserting ok. Excluded-focus captures must be all black. Summary-only screen.look cannot provide outside-target geometry."
  ]
}
